  "text": " Oh, there's a, it seems to be a family gathering and the parents are sitting in a blanket. The man, the father is reading a book and the mother is pouring something into a glass. And they have the radio and a pet basket and footplops on the blanket. And the older boy is, maybe it's not the older boy, but flying a kite and there's another boy on the boogie board in the water and a dog is near the older boy flying a kite. And there's a sand and a sand shovel and a bucket in the sand. And there's a dog where somebody is fishing and there's a 10 foot cell boat with two people in it and one of the people is waving. They look to be on a lake because there's evergreen trees surrounding the lake and there's a flagpole with a flag that doesn't have an emblem. It's blank, blank and there's a house with a car and a car parked outside the garage and a big tree behind the car near the blanket. And there are a lot of trees.",
